  "changelog": "Initial release providing simplified water yield, retention, and purification mapping.\n\n- Computes water yield using a Budyko-style water balance approach, with tunable \u03c9 soil-water parameter.\n- Calculates water retention and nitrogen purification based on NDVI-modulated coefficients.\n- Supports both synthetic and real multi-band GeoTIFF input, with batch and quiet processing modes.\n- Outputs water yield, water retention, and nutrient retention in GeoTIFF format, along with parameter and manifest JSON files.\n- Fully offline operation, ensuring user privacy; all computations are local.",
